WEBVTT

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:22.080
Looking up at the purple panorama of the galaxy highway...

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:30.190
...a shooting star pierces my heart.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:38.000
synchronized with the sleepless city...
My accelerating heartbeat is

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.770
...and I suddenly pray for the unseen tomorrow...

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.010
...that brings that melody.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.950
A mysterious voice won't let me go.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:03.560
Oh, tell me seventh moon, this frustrated heart...

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.330
...where will you take me to?

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:15.840
To sway in the blue seventh moon...

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:25.750
...searching for the answer to the rhythm in this crazy dance.

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:39.580
In the year 2009, humanity
encountered its first alien race.

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:44.900
The result was an intergalactic war with a militaristic race of giants called Zentraedi.

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:47.850
The Earth was thrown into what
seemed a never-ending crisis.

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:51.550
In the year 2010, March,
the war was brought to an end.

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:54.460
In April of the same year,
the New Unity Government was established...

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:58.410
...bringing together mankind and the
Zentraedi into peaceful co-existence.

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:04.610
This resulted in a mass micronization of the remaining Zentraedi via the "Micron Process."

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:10.600
In September of 2011, the Unity Government devised a colonization plan...

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:13.010
...centered upon the preservation
of the human race.

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:16.360
In September of the next year,
the first colonial transport...

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.110
...the Megaroad One
began its journey.

00:02:19.710 --> 00:02:23.990
In September of 2030, the first of
the new Macross-class transports...

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:28.100
...a gigantic vessel dwarfing its Megaroad predecessor, departed Earth.

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.470
These ships could carry in
excess of one million people.

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:39.650
In 2038, the 37th colonial expedition, the
7th Macross fleet, launched from earth orbit.

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:42.050
Its destination -- the Galactic Core.

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:44.630
It is now 2045...

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:50.200
Captain Max !  We've received an
SOS from the advanced guard !

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.600
An unidentified force has
launched a surprise attack.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:54.790
What's that ?

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:58.050
Looks like they're in
the middle of a battle.

00:02:58.600 --> 00:02:59.590
Let's do it !

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:06.500
Nekki Basara.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:07.410
Unbelievable !

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:10.600
You're interfering in
a military operation !

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.000
Is he following in the
footsteps of Linn Minmei ?

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:17.950
Primary operation complete !
Return to base !

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:20.650
Wait a minute !
It's not over yet !

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:37.350
"SPIRITIA" LEVEL

00:03:54.700 --> 00:04:14.700
If you become the wind,
I want to become the endless sky.

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:15.700
Docker...

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:33.850
How is he ?

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:36.860
Well, I've never seen a
condition like this before.

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:41.700
His vital signs
are growing weaker.

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:43.700
He's hovering between
life and death.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:46.660
But I can't pin it
on anything documented.

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:49.140
It's as if all of them lack
the energy to simply live.

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:50.300
What ?

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:53.450
At the moment,
there's no way to treat it.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:07.420
I'll finish it,
next time.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:11.180
Boroughneize leader reports
everything normal.

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:13.350
Have you received a
report from SES yet ?

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:15.810
No. It's taking
longer than usual.

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:17.860
There's simply not
enough data to analyze.

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:20.730
We cannot determine what kind of
weapons they appear to be using.

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:23.420
All right, why don't we
send out some Conserax ?

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:26.420
Captain, a Mr. Lovelock
is here to see you.

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:29.500
Oh, is it that
time already ?

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:44.340
If I can relieve you from your sadness,
I'll keep singing...

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:50.430
...until my voice grows hoarse.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:11.200
Geez !  Won't you
leave me alone ?!

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:12.530
How long are you
going to follow me ?

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:15.860
Until you stop.
Where are you going ?

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:20.710
Mylene, pull over !

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:22.570
Yeah, right !

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:28.810
What are you doing ?
Keep on her tail !

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:30.470
It's impossible !
I can't !

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:34.360
She's going into Akusho !

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.300
After her !

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:39.200
Akusho's a dangerous area and hasn't been registered as part of the fleet.

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:40.450
Why would she go there ?

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:41.400
Just follow her !

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:41.950
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:47.930
What are you doing ?

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:53.000
Michael !

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:02.960
Ray ! Ray !

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:09.970
Ray !
Are you in ?

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:11.470
Ray...

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:13.210
Keep it down !
Ray's not in !

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:16.420
Where did he go ?

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:17.200
I don't know.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:18.960
Geez !

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:23.400
Hey, will you let me in ?

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:24.850
Why should I ?

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:27.410
Hey, stop with the questions,
just let me in !

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:29.350
Come in if you want.

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:31.170
How do I get in ?

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:32.930
The downstairs
door is open.

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:33.610
Downstairs ?

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:37.420
What is this place ?

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:43.700
Weird room !

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:46.360
If you don't like it,
you don't have to come in.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:48.240
I didn't say that.

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:57.150
Hey, is there
any place to hide ?

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:58.850
Hide anywhere you want.

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:14.980
Excuse me.

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.450
Are you Nekki Basara ?

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:18.680
And you are ?

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:20.040
Mayor Miria.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.650
You are ?

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:24.880
Not me ! Are you even
aware of who the Mayor is ?

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:26.620
Thirty years ago...

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.600
Oh, come on, Guvava !
What are you doing ?!

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:33.340
...and received more than 90%
of the votes in the election !

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:34.350
I know.

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:37.910
Where is Miss Mylene ?!

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:39.180
I don't know.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:40.500
I know you're hiding her...

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.350
That tickles, Guvava !
I know you're hiding her...

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:44.480
...if you keep playing
innocent with me.

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:46.700
I really don't
know where she is.

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:47.720
She must be here !

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:54.350
How dare you !

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:56.560
No one steps a foot in
my room unless I say so !

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:58.640
I'm kinda busy.
Later.

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.690
Stop acting as if
you know nothing !

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:05.580
Family problems should be
kept within the family.

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:06.060
What ?!

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:07.330
Michael !

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:12.370
Mylene !
I know you're in there !

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:15.100
You know I'll never allow
you to live on your own.

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:16.280
Come back home immediately !

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:50.850
Hey, it's here.

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:55.250
Hey, how did you get it ?

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:55.960
What ?

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:56.640
The Valkyrie.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:58.700
Ray gave it to me.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:09:59.450
From Ray ?

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:00.500
Yeah.
From Ray ?

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.200
Where'd he get it ?

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:03.300
Don't know.
Where'd he get it ?

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:08.310
Hey, how could you
do such a thing ?

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:09.320
Do what ?

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:11.840
Jump into a battle
while you were singing ?

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:14.350
It's something
I've wanted to do.

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:19.660
Come on ! Did you think you
could just quit the concert ?

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:22.670
Didn't you think you could have
gotten into trouble or danger ?

00:10:22.670 --> 00:10:24.130
What if you'd been killed ?!

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:25.870
Wha ?

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:30.340
Don't you have any
sense of responsibility ?

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:34.760
We're just musicians and we
have an audience to perform for !

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:40.240
Our job is to perform songs, to sing
from the heart and to entertain them !

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:41.850
Yeah.

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:44.480
Don't give me that !

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:47.790
Let me ask you this, why were
you singing out there ?

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:49.660
Don't you understand ?

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:51.950
No, I don't.
That's why...!

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:55.000
I sure am thirsty. Do you have
anything cold to drink ?

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:59.410
There's some lemonade in the refrigerator downstairs. Bring me some.

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:05.700
What's that ?

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:07.170
What ?

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:09.370
Oh, nothing.

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:14.340
Now I know why the girl
I replaced quit the band.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:22.150
So many straws.

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:24.280
Why does he have so many
straws in the refrigerator ?

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:32.580
I guess a lot of girls must
come by to see him.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:36.000
Hey, do you have girls coming
by your place often ?

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:39.810
Hey ! Those straws
are for girls, right ?

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:49.780
Hey !
Did anyone bring them ?

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:54.230
Hey, why don't
you answer me ?

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:56.870
Basara !

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:08.550
Basara !

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:12.630
Basara, are you in ?

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.050
Oh, excuse me.

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:17.750
Ray...

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:18.660
Yeah.
Ray...

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:19.650
Come in.

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:20.850
Okay.
Come in.

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:22.930
Ray, what's wrong ?

00:12:23.420 --> 00:12:24.340
Nothing.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:25.720
Where did you go ?

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:27.430
Well, I had something to do.

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:30.030
Well, you weren't
here when I needed you.

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:31.650
What happened ?

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:34.830
No idea. The mayor
came by on a visit.

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:36.650
Your mom ?

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:38.450
What was she doing here ?

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:41.820
She's trying to force me
into an arranged marriage.

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:42.700
An arranged marriage ?

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:46.840
Yup. She's already decided on
who my husband is going to be.

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:48.050
Isn't that horrible ?

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:50.350
I don't know.

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:52.420
That isn't funny.

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:56.750
All right, all right. Anyway,
we need to get the stage ready, first.

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:58.760
It's starting an
hour earlier today.

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:00.000
Veffidas is there already.

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:18.210
It looks like they were able
to sound the alarm this time.

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.850
The enemy's back
for another round ?

00:13:20.850 --> 00:13:21.850
Maybe.

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:26.700
Hey, Basara !
What about the gig ?

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:29.830
What about our fans ?

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:32.940
Irresponsible, irresponsible, irresponsible !

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:35.680
I'll make it back in time !

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:40.320
Liar ! You're always late !
Don't you even care about our gig ?

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:46.400
It's bad enough that you sing in battle,
but leaving your fans high and dry ?!

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:47.910
Talk about stupidity !

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:51.750
Oh, shut up !
You don't understand yet !

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:55.000
And what's that ?
What do you think singing is ?

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:57.470
Singing is the burning
heart of passion !

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:08.800
Geez ! What if you get killed ?!

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:19.960
Basara, you can try going over it again and again to see if your song will be recognized.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:36.850
Defense line one: B formation. Markreis, Shibacris, accelerating toward the line.

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:38.350
What about Diamond Force ?

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:41.850
Ensign Physica has received his
orders and is preparing to launch.

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:52.850
We want to stop them from
getting within range of our fleet.

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:53.950
Right.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:54.850
What's the Conseraxs' status ?

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:58.500
The Boroughneize is launching them now.
Conserax, TA-1, one pack.

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:12.060
This really sucks !

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:19.060
You...understand that ?

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:20.260
What ?

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:21.850
Basara's notes...

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:24.260
Yeah.
It's a nice tune.

00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:26.060
You can understand it ?

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:27.850
Alright, let's go.

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:30.500
The gig ?
What about Basara ?

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:31.860
He'll probably
be late again.

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:41.250
The second wave leader is mounting a counterattack. The fleet commander...

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:46.850
Gamlin, Physica, we're running a little behind them, but we'll catch up with F2 and XO.

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:47.750
Roger.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:51.750
Docker, I'm taking them down
for you, and for Diamond Force.

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:11.600
Spiritia Level 55.

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:22.750
The Spiritia increases in times of crisis.
This group's mean value is high.

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:28.250
How about attacking
the main fleet ?

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:29.750
That isn't our objective.

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:30.750
Yes, sir.

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:41.350
D-Force launch in twenty seconds.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:44.550
Markreis is preparing
to launch fighters.

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:47.550
It's him !

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:52.950
Sir. This is D-2,
a Code V9 Valkyrie...

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:55.550
F2 and XO.
No changes!

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:56.800
D-Force, launch !

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.250
Captain, we have a
visual from Conserax.

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:03.250
Okay.

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:05.250
Analysis unit !

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.350
Connecting on channel 32.

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:12.650
Conserax controller,
head to the fighter's cockpit !

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:17.990
Can't see anything.

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:24.600
It can't be.
They're...

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.410
What's wrong, Advisor Exedore ?

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:27.940
No, it's nothing.

00:17:31.140 --> 00:17:34.050
Well, that couldn't
possibly happen.

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:36.420
That craft is about the
right size for an Earthling.

00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:38.250
Advisor...

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:41.830
Captain !
A code V9 Valkyrie has...

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:46.370
That's him.

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:51.150
What is this ?

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:54.470
His Spiritia level is strange.
I've been waiting for him.

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:59.840
Civilian, withdraw !
Get out of the battlezone !

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.940
ID Code V9 !
Please withdraw !

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:05.230
I'm going to
take your Spiritia !

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:07.270
This is a battlezone !

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:10.420
This battle is senseless !
Listen to my song !

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:38.660
Let's get started, it's Saturday Night.
How're you guys doin' ?

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:42.890
Let's stand up, do you feel the beat ?

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:47.570
This is a flying paradise.
A forgotten energy...

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:49.990
Withdraw !  Get out of here !
This is a flying paradise.
A forgotten energy...

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:50.850
This is a flying paradise.
A forgotten energy...

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:53.700
Now hurry up, and take it back.

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:55.270
I told you, you're getting in the way !
Now hurry up, and take it back.

00:18:57.630 --> 00:18:59.720
No more wastin' time.

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:00.650
Before everything fades away like a dream...

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:03.570
You're interfering in military affairs.
Why haven't you been arrested yet ?

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:04.820
Before everything fades away like a dream...

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:06.650
D-2, forget about him !
Before everything fades away like a dream...

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:09.390
Before everything fades away like a dream...

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:11.570
Give me an answer !
What are you trying to do ?

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:15.660
Hey, everybody ! Aim at the light.

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:17.750
Answer me !  Why are you singing ?
Hey, everybody ! Aim at the light.

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:17.780
Hey, everybody ! Aim at the light.

00:19:17.780 --> 00:19:18.150
Let's dance. Dancing on the planet dance.

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:19.350
Answer me !
Let's dance. Dancing on the planet dance.

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:22.100
Let's dance. Dancing on the planet dance.

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:22.840
Why are you singing ?
Let's dance. Dancing on the planet dance.

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:23.680
Why are you singing ?

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:25.040
Answer me !

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:26.460
A liar sings a sad song of surrender.
Answer me !

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:27.700
A liar sings a sad song of surrender.

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:29.820
I said, answer me !
A liar sings a sad song of surrender.

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:30.780
A liar sings a sad song of surrender.

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:30.840
No thanks ! You're of no help.

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:31.820
Why ?!
No thanks ! You're of no help.

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:34.830
No thanks ! You're of no help.

