It sure got me excited.

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:29.090
Nobody gave him a
hand for his song.

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:35.250
Hey, do you know
where Mylene went ?

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:37.770
Well, she was
here a minute ago.

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:53.490
This is getting on my nerves.
Nobody listened to my song.

00:21:54.880 --> 00:21:55.490
Basara !

00:21:57.740 --> 00:21:58.950
What are you doing ?

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:03.110
Our gig is
about to begin !

00:22:17.260 --> 00:22:20.310
Aren't you going back to the gig ?
Our audience is waiting for us !

00:22:24.080 --> 00:22:25.750
You said that you'd
make it back in time.

00:22:25.750 --> 00:22:27.720
You're a liar, liar, liar !

00:22:29.810 --> 00:22:32.950
Oh, shut up ! I didn't say
I wasn't going to the gig.

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:37.370
You're late. Are you going to make Veffidas
and Ray repeat the intro this time, too ?

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:40.140
Why not ?

00:23:07.210 --> 00:23:13.390
Our voices synchronize just like falling in love and kissing.

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:23.530
My heart is always here for you.

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:30.700
But, oh! I wonder what your shining eyes...

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:39.680
...are searching for ? Oh, My Friends !

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:51.360
I'm going to run with you toward a star where our dreams are.

00:23:53.260 --> 00:24:03.070
When we look at each other everything will become real.

